  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p> You roll around on the ground, both hands clasped to the ruin of your face.</p> <p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Prone] and Broken. You suffer a Broken Bone (Major) and also lose various parts – Amputation (Hard). Roll three times and ignore but don’t reroll any multiples of an already rolled result: \n Roll 1d10: \n 1-2 Left ear \n 3-4 Right ear \n 5-6 Nose \n 7 1d10 teeth \n 8 Another 1d10 teeth \n 9 One eye \n 10 Both eyes</p>"
